{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1416612-would-an-exalted-video-game-look-like-this-adventures-in-castle-heterodyne","id":1416612,"title":"Would an Exalted video game look like this? Adventures In Castle Heterodyne","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-03T04:51:21-07:00","id":1416612,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Would an Exalted video game look like this? Adventures In Castle Heterodyne","content":"<b><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/ggadventures/girl-genius-adventures-in-castle-heterodyne\" target=\"_blank\">Girl Genius - Adventures In Castle Heterodyne</a></b> based on <a href=\"https://girlgeniusonline.com/comic.php\" target=\"_blank\">this online graphic novel.</a><br /> <br /> I've often found an interesting parallel between the Phil &amp; Kaja Foglio's <b>Sparks</b> &amp; Exalted's <b>Solars</b> (especially the Twilight Caste &amp; other craft focused Solars).<br /> <br /> What do you think? Could this game be inspiration or an Exalted game with adventure &amp; craft elements?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 10-13-2020, 07:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-03T17:34:24-07:00","id":1416657,"title":"","content":"The insanity and madness is of course, fitting for Solars. As does the Coffee scene. <br /> <br /> But of course you'll have to do some railroading. Solar powers are so varied and useful that they have a habit of breaking any roadmap you have. A small dungeon quest for a craft supernal is something that certainly fits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T07:38:30-07:00","id":1416724,"title":"","content":"This link should be more helpful: <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/ggadventures/girl-genius-adventures-in-castle-heterodyne\" target=\"_blank\">Girl Genius: Adventures in Castle Heterodyne</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-04T09:42:16-07:00","id":1416732,"title":"","content":"Eh... Girl Genius is overall too late 19th/early 20th century and too German to really hit the Exalted notes, I think. Though the game does look cool.<br /> <br /> The best Exalted video game I can think of is probably Jade Empire. The power scale isn't quite right (except maybe for a Dragonblooded game), but everything else fits perfectly-- a fantasy China setting, crazy martial arts that sometimes cross the line into outright magic, the world spinning out of balance because someone messed with the gods...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-07T07:41:18-07:00","id":1417142,"title":"","content":"I could write a whole bunch on how Exalted fits into RPG canon, but some other time. Suffice to say, Exalted comes from a time when video game RPGs were showing that they could do the rules-heavy-skirmish-combat thing as good or better than TTRPGs. So it's not surprising that the things that we tend to think of as really making Exalted <i>Exalted</i> are things you basically can't replicate with a video game. It leans <i>hard</i> into the benefits of having a human Storyteller instead of a narrative or a physics engine and the power of player's imaginations instead of an art budget.<br /> <br /> Does that mean you can't have an Exalted video game? Of course not. You just have to adapt it into a very different medium. Like when D&amp;D became Neverwinter, or Masquerade became Bloodlines, or WoW became Hearthstone, or... Exalted became War for the Throne.<br /> <br /> Edit: regarding the OP question, which I basically take to be &quot;could Girl Genius be to (Hypothetical Exalted Video Game) as Neverwinter was to KotOR or Dynasty Warriors was to Hyrule Warriors&quot;...<br /> I got bored 3/4 of the way through the KS video and still hadn't seen any hints of gameplay so I'm not really sure <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","user":"Blackwell","date":". 10-07-2020, 11:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T16:52:56-07:00","id":1418119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1416612-would-an-exalted-video-game-look-like-this-adventures-in-castle-heterodyne?p=1417142#post1417142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I got bored 3/4 of the way through the KS video and still hadn't seen any hints of gameplay so I'm not really sure <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Lol!<br /> <br /> Too true.<br /> <br /> We will have to wait &amp; see what the final product is to know for sure.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-07T01:21:33-07:00","id":1485968,"title":"","content":"Thats really awesome game!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27000-adamsmith","name":"AdamSmith","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","